  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5505.01 Public List.\n\n(a) The division shall maintain a separate, public list of:\n\n(1) All tier I, tier II, and tier III offenders who are required to register as a result of an offense against a child;\n\n(2) Any offender about whom the division receives notice pursuant to RSA 651-B:4, V that will be required to register as a result of an offense against children; and\n\n(3) Any offender who is required to register for more than one sexual offense or offense against a child.\n\n(b) The list shall include all the information set out in RSA 651-B:7, III (a) and (b), if available.\n\nSource. #5537, eff 1-1-93; ss by #6314, EMERGENCY eff 8-9-96, EXPIRES: 12-7-96; ss by #6324, INTERIM eff 8-22-96, EXPIRES: 12-20-96; ss by #6358, eff 10-22-96; ss by #6919, INTERIM, eff 1-1-99, EXPIRES: 5-1-99; ss by #6990, EMERGENCY, eff 4-30-99, EXPIRES: 8-28-99; ss by #7066, eff 7-28-99; amd by #7649, eff 2-20-02; amd by #7982, INTERIM eff 10-30-03, EXPIRED: 4-27-04; ss by #8083, eff 5-11-04; ss by #10121, eff 4-25-12; ss by #13504, eff 12-9-22",
